{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Fillomino》是一款純粹的區塊邏輯解謎遊戲，專為熱愛深度思考的玩家設計。它沒有廣告、沒有計時器、沒有體力限制，讓你隨時隨地都能沉浸在無壓力的解謎體驗中。今天這款 premium 遊戲正限時免費中，無論你是 Sudoku 或數織愛好者，還是想找一款離線腦力訓練工具，都千萬別錯過。</p>\n\n<h2>無限謎題，離線暢玩</h2>\n<p>遊戲提供五種棋盤尺寸，從 5×5 快速挑戰到 9×9 終極考驗，每個謎題都由引擎即時生成，永不重複。你只需遵循三條簡單規則——填入數字、連接相同數字形成區塊、確保區塊大小等於數字——就能逐步破解邏輯謎題。隨著解謎累積經驗值，還能解鎖超過 100 個等級與 24 項成就，讓每一次思考都充滿成就感。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2048x2732bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2048x2732bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Everyday Puzzles: Fillomino</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T01:51:45.554844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}